    {
      "itemId": "wurrtowa",
      "name": "Wurrtowa",
      "pointsCost": 25,
      "costNote": null,
      "category": null,
      "effects": [
        "The bearer:",
        "Gains the Psyker keyword",
        "Reduces its Transport 24 and Firing Deck 24 abilities to Transport 12 and Firing Deck 12.",
        "This model knows the following Psychic Attacks:",
        "Eadbanga",
        "Eyez of Gork",
        "The bearer gains the following Special Ability:",
        "Spirit of Gork (Psychic): Once per battle round, when this model is activated, it can attempt to channel the Spirit of Gork. If the Psychic Test is passed, roll a D6. On a roll of a 1, this model suffers D3+1 Mortal Wounds. On a roll of a 2-5, select 1 of the following abilities to be in effect until the end of the Battle Round:",
        "Increase the Movement characteristic of this model by 3\"",
        "Increase the Initiative characteristic of this model by 2",
        "This model gains the Relentless ability",
        "Friendly Beast Snaggas Klan units with at least 1 model within 6\" of this model (including units embarked in this model) increase their Strength characteristic by 1",
        "On a roll of a 6, all the above are considered to be in effect until the end of the Battle Round, and all units with at least 1 model within 6\" of this model suffer D3 Mortal Wounds."
      ],
      "effectsHtml": "<ul>\n<li>The bearer:</li>\n<li>Gains the <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"psyker\" data-type=\"keyword\">Psyker</span> keyword</li>\n<li>Reduces its <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"transport-24\" data-type=\"keyword\">Transport 24</span> and <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"firing-deck-24\" data-type=\"keyword\">Firing Deck 24</span> abilities to <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"transport-12\" data-type=\"keyword\">Transport 12</span> and <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"firing-deck-12\" data-type=\"keyword\">Firing Deck 12</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This model knows the following Psychic Attacks:</p>\n<p><span class=\"weapon-ref\" data-weapon=\"eadbanga\">Eadbanga</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"weapon-ref\" data-weapon=\"eyez-of-gork\">Eyez of Gork</span></p>\n<p>The bearer gains the following Special Ability:</p>\n<p><strong>Spirit of Gork (Psychic):</strong> Once per battle round, when this model is activated, it can attempt to channel the Spirit of Gork. If the Psychic Test is passed, roll a D6. On a roll of a 1, this model suffers D3+1 Mortal Wounds. On a roll of a 2-5, select 1 of the following abilities to be in effect until the end of the Battle Round:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Increase the Movement characteristic of this model by 3\"</li>\n<li>Increase the Initiative characteristic of this model by 2</li>\n<li>This model gains the Relentless ability</li>\n<li>Friendly <span class=\"keyword\" data-term=\"beast-snaggas-klan\" data-type=\"keyword\">Beast Snaggas Klan</span> units with at least 1 model within 6\" of this model (including units embarked in this model) increase their Strength characteristic by 1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a roll of a 6, all the above are considered to be in effect until the end of the Battle Round, and all units with at least 1 model within 6\" of this model suffer D3 Mortal Wounds.</p>",
